ollama
# Coverage output. Anchored deliberately: the previous pattern was `*cover*`,
# an unanchored glob that matched any path containing "cover" -- which silently
# ignored `components/recovery/`, and would equally swallow `discovery`,
# `coverflow`, or anything else with those six letters in it. A whole feature
# directory was invisible to `git status` and `git add -A` because of it, and
# nothing warns you: the files simply are not there.
/app/coverage/
coverage.out
*.cover.out
.vscode
.env
.DS_Store
.claude
